From 29576a104295be7c54a0efde4b2b7ed49423e3e0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Joseph <joseph@giallovision.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 00:54:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Sweep Depth: ComfyUI /view download, background OpenCV render
 with trail/smoothing and cache; beat_clock + mod_live CHOPs; fix cross1

The depth video lives outside the share (ComfyUI output, container mount),
so TD downloads it from ComfyUI's /view. The mask video is rendered in a
worker thread (cv2 + numpy) instead of a Script TOP + timeline capture,
cached per depth video/look/frames; short init videos are learned from the
depth video. New beat_clock and mod_live CHOPs line live visuals up with the
render; setup_network corrects the cross1 overshoot.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BhiEzmwUbwDK67k3BY9b4Y
